The HiveServer2 interface in vendor/TCLIService.thrift is from Apache Hive 3.1.3:
https://github.com/apache/hive/blob/rel/release-3.1.3/service-rpc/if/TCLIService.thrift
Copyright The Apache Software Foundation. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

src/connector/t_c_l_i_service.rs is generated from that interface using Apache
Thrift 0.24.0, with reproducible generator corrections in scripts/generate/thrift.sh.

The theme definitions in themes/ are bundled from the GPUI Kit themes directory:
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit/tree/main/themes
GPUI Kit is licensed under Apache-2.0. Each theme file retains its author and
source URL metadata.

The connection protocol follows the publicly documented HiveServer2 protocol and
the behavior of Apache Kyuubi's PyHive client. Qrow does not bundle Python or Java.

Rust dependencies retain their respective open-source licenses. See Cargo.lock
for the resolved dependency list and each package's license metadata. This build
is a personal prototype, not a prepared public distribution.

The Postgres icon in assets/connection-type-icons/postgres.svg is from Devicon:
https://github.com/devicons/devicon/blob/d98a72cb9a6d8e543ddbddc32bac231572349e96/icons/postgresql/postgresql-plain.svg
Its fill color is changed to black. The interface applies the theme icon color.
For the 16 px icon size, the thin outer outline is removed and the gaps between
the ears and the head are wider.

